    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">:tick:</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Activate/Deactivate<br>
      Partial update</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">PATCH</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">/firms/{firm-id}</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
      <p>request&nbsp; body</p>
      <div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
       <div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
        <pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=
=3D"brush: java; gutter: false">{ "status": "active / inactive"
}</pre>
       </div>
      </div>
     </div></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p><br></p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">if status =3D inactive, mark the firm and it=
's RR ranges as active =3D false. Refer firm's state transition.</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>update as per State Transition -</p>
     <p>activation - <a href=3D"/spaces/NA/pages/1336995931/Manage+Firm#Man=
ageFirm-3">Manage Firm#3</a></p>
     <p>de-activation - <a href=3D"/spaces/NA/pages/1336995931/Manage+Firm#=
ManageFirm-4">Manage Firm#4</a></p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">pcm:edit_firm</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"highlight-#e3fcef confluenceTd" data-highlight-colour=3D"#=
e3fcef" title=3D"Background color : Light green 35%">
     <h4 id=3D"FirmManagementAPI-FM6">FM6</h4></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">:tick:</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Off-boarding</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">DELETE</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">/firms/{firm-id}</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <ul>
      <li>firm-id</li>
     </ul></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <ul>
      <li>200 OK if the status is inactive</li>
     </ul></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p><s>if state=3Dinactive and status_last_updated is more than 7 years=
